    "mail.forgotten.body": "Waxaad la socotay \"{title}\" {count} bishii la soo dhaafay, laakiin {days} maalmood ayaa ka soo wareegay tii ugu dambaysay. Haddii aad rabto inaad isdabajoogga sii wado, kaliya fur guddiga dhinaca ee Attendance Tracker marka xigta ee aad kulankaas ku jirto — wuxuu ka sii wadaa meeshii aad joojisay.\n\nTaxanahaaga ilaa hadda: {link}\n\n— Derek",
